{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6899c0ad69f315ac611aef1ce1177ef2f94915cbfb61c4b2aaeee5af195f56db", "ja": "リリースイベントも無事成功し、やよい達は\n約束通り流れ星を見つけたキャンプ場へとや\nって来た。楽しそうに駆け回る環と育。心地\nよい日差しの下、うたた寝を始めた可奈にや\nよいは声をかける。…おやすみなさい♪", "zh": "发片活动圆满落幕，弥生等人依照约定来到了\n之前看到流星的露营地，环和育开心地四处奔\n跑玩耍。在和煦的阳光下，弥生向开始打瞌睡\n的可奈搭话……晚安♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ca8d2eaff1473cc57adbb36ce6f9f96cc732d660d6779a026aa268c5feae8aef", "ja": "（新曲のリリース公演は、大成功を収めた！\nそして約束通り、今日は皆と打ち上げだ）", "zh": "（新歌发片公演以大成功收场！\n依照约定，今天要帮大家办庆功宴。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f3b294eaf5532455d05cb23f75c0acc1714f353918665c4f520337fc2dbfda97", "ja": "（渓谷でのバーベキューに、川遊び。\n4人とも、今日は朝からずっと笑顔だな）", "zh": "（在溪谷烤肉加上河边玩水，\n她们四个人从早上开始就一直挂着笑容呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "26472f48f439c9addb2398d8e585640c2912ddaf8ce14c7a16f3b997a6f30d01", "ja": "みんな、この辺のお肉焼けたから、\nもう食べても大丈夫だよー！", "zh": "各位，这边的肉已经烤好了，\n可以吃了喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "2a2c6316d395d6ee8b110e649bb78b26bb5cdea80143bc562332e15d585fce40", "ja": "わーい！　やよいちゃん、ありがとう！\nたまき、お腹ペコペコだぞ～。", "zh": "哇──！弥生，谢谢你！\n环的肚子已经饿扁扁了喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "fcda37e9b0ff158cbe40b0f60824866d175fabd24293156824009c17be957ff1", "ja": "もやしもたくさんあるからね。\n食べたい人は、取りに来ましょー！", "zh": "也有很多豆芽菜喔，\n想吃的人就过来拿吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "0fbe0123ca9974546fc07aedc9f3d8eb0e8b82398a6a564072c7290c2f92e95a", "ja": "あ、食べる！　えへへ、やよいさんのお料理、\nおいしくて大好きっ！　ありがとう！", "zh": "啊，我要吃！嘿嘿，弥生姊姊做的菜\n真好吃，我最喜欢了！谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "463c9241741861209deb7fd8c5904ff2d6316504456fd67e1ef2bdda12b1d556", "ja": "こっちにはデザート、焼きバナナ～♪\n皮ごと焼いて～、とろとろかな～♪", "zh": "这个是甜点，炭火烤香蕉～♪\n连皮一起烤～黏糊不用嚼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "619ee689a7cbb01908d2ff012fcde0647be2e88c068fdc093a7b23982818dd93", "ja": "可奈、ひとつくれるか？", "zh": "可奈，可以给我一个吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "36faa4cb56ef0f498bcedea0db5b028fae0b0f1ad3fb31c5c66ff530e6d0d661", "ja": "は～い、わかりました！\nチョコレートかけますから、ちょっと待ってください。", "zh": "好～我知道了！\n帮你加上巧克力，请稍等一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "0655eae1bc760ad68da8c1de404ba2a5a3275709cddb8c63651edf5fdc2344c3", "ja": "愛情たっぷり焼きバナナ～♪\n{$P$}さん、召し上がれ～♪", "zh": "满怀爱情的烤香蕉～♪\n{$P$}先生，请享用～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "6ba832c11b3a898381a0d30c010f01922faf9d40f8abb7a7021ae9c9b11519c5", "ja": "ねえねえ、育！\nたまきと一緒に石切りやろう！", "zh": "欸欸，育！\n和环一起打水漂吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "778d245362ffaa67f78b09e71d231908958100f18cbfe0f144fb9dd3e4d496c3", "ja": "うん、いいよ！", "zh": "嗯，好喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "6082986d3b40fb47ee3d7f5f11547a623ecebb60581f9d30c1031cf1ae3b1c26", "ja": "やった～！\nどっちの回数が多いか勝負ねっ！", "zh": "太好了～！\n来比谁跳比较多次喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "47d7db1c2008e3d86e70daad42315d45a9a399a81329ced4b63ea5bac90d543f", "ja": "ふたりともー！\n危ないから、あんまり遠くに行っちゃダメだよー！", "zh": "你们两个──！\n不要跑太远，很危险喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f54a94ab3d63d0efe15527972870bda0a6fc85d69f409039ac931922fcd5b902", "ja": "……よし、これで終わり、と。\nやよい、洗い物終わったぞ。", "zh": "……好，这样就完成了。\n弥生，我把东西洗好了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "b28bedea126815e918849d67c0ffac2aaaab95439d9b23353b5cb5e9e797c7c7", "ja": "ありがとうございますー！　{$P$}が\n手伝ってくれたから、お片付けが早く終わりました！", "zh": "谢谢你──！因为有{$P$}\n你的帮忙，才能这么快就把东西收拾完毕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "4516a64c56f53aceeee90a8d128770fb911e4281996e15eb02e2fb49912b41c9", "ja": "可奈ちゃんも料理手伝ってくれて、ありがとね！\nすごく助かっちゃった！", "zh": "可奈也有帮忙做菜，谢谢啰！\n真是帮了我一个大忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "b10df8ee6b6004b2a90f03cb78b342f515d530eb72aee2642e158604f1b61219", "ja": "ううん、私もやよいちゃんと一緒に\nお料理ができて、すごく楽しかった～♪", "zh": "不不，能和弥生一起做菜，\n我也觉得非常开心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d9f09a96f2f9db75caa72bdb9289947b6f9708ac06155fd0aef0e7c03f5cb7c9", "ja": "ふたりも遊びに行ってきたらどうだ？\n荷物は俺が見ておくよ。", "zh": "你们两个也去玩玩吧？\n行李让我来看就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "e2b310b35fd22dfece8ae03e034ea73730300d3f0227eb941b19c09aca9998eb", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　でも、お片付けでちょっぴり\n疲れちゃったから、休憩してからにしようかなーって。", "zh": "谢谢你！但是整理完东西有点累了，\n我打算先休息一下再去玩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "1681cca27e3a891d04a31611b68332fdbd0a7c38ae77b148caeb56ad033f9861", "ja": "私も、のんびりしちゃおう～っと……ふわぁ～。", "zh": "我也来放松一下好了……呵啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "527f7f6708f4881dd4c5478b7426d2d9d57b0017d3635416d054ff55754049a6", "ja": "えへへ、お日様が気持ちいいですね～……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，太阳晒得好舒服呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "db6a750c367a9d42da89a4620314cc61f3cc32754ea0493a89f5e81acdf4d287", "ja": "ああ、晴れてよかったな。\nおかげで楽しい打ち上げになりそうだ。", "zh": "是啊，幸好今天是晴天，\n我们才能有一场开心的庆功宴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1025_005yay", "source_sha256": "02aa21bd11eef645e78f3c224e79924752f186d72787e7bde03fb3c4a0d50314", "ja": "はい！　新曲を歌わせてもらえて、\nリリース公演も成功して……。", "zh": "是的！有机会演唱新歌，\n发片公演也大功告成……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "d0dff3ec190b2072517011f29305fcab3293a4447510dbf7249be1b82f3a4aa9", "ja": "私って、とっても幸せ者ですねっ。\nえへへ、いっぱいレッスン頑張ってよかったです！", "zh": "我真是个幸福的人呢！\n嘿嘿，有认真努力练习真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "ce11e08bf8d7ded3a5520d74f279a3beabdcbd053b7f16d98ef8584a91cc8d9e", "ja": "……そうだな。もしかしたら、\n今日もこの前も、こんなに晴れたのは……。", "zh": "……没错，说不定，\n今天和上一次天气都这么好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "ce216b2d0f7a1c5cfee0548a1aa1e193fa60aa071d10db6d41d4715de893dd3f", "ja": "いつも頑張ってるみんなへの、\n神様のご褒美かもしれないぞ？", "zh": "是神明看大家总是这么努力，\n而给大家的奖励喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "d21a12f01cd37907fe363cad88c3d8d90e1d44e50774c1e0c4090de63fa41bca", "ja": "神様からの、ご褒美……あ！　あの歌の歌詞って、\nそういう意味だったのかも！？", "zh": "神明的奖励……啊！那首歌的歌词\n说不定就是这个意思！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1030_005yay", "source_sha256": "0defe6dadee6f1daddc5834c7f462a34e5aa84f27189c346b8caaa2b2650a9a7", "ja": "ねっ、可奈ちゃんもそう思わない！？\n可奈ちゃん……あれ？", "zh": "欸，可奈你不觉得吗！？\n可奈……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "b894fcae84869e9d7b0d8e49675913f6aabc1fd67889388db3850b5ffe34ae9a", "ja": "すぅ……すぅ……すぅ……", "zh": "呼……呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1033_005yay", "source_sha256": "fbba152f76027f508d0aa23e099a8e2e2d861c530e0697b5db8afa7222a541d4", "ja": "あ、可奈ちゃん……。", "zh": "啊，可奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "085e13d6ae2df35e2a4405ba4369706ed09e9e7827fb6f233f2b27aac17da96f", "ja": "寝ちゃってるな。", "zh": "她睡着了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_07_1035_005yay", "source_sha256": "3fa354a157faaf2398fb6ec57f2dba61f0be0f773e4269532eba932435e16952", "ja": "お料理のお手伝い、\nいっぱい頑張ってくれたから、疲れちゃったんですね。", "zh": "因为她在做菜的时候努力帮了很多忙，\n所以累了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
